  "premise": "Reborn in a world where people's skills are ranked by stars, a girl whose Tamer skill has no stars is treated as a curse and abused by her family and village. Helped in secret by the village fortune teller Luba, she flees, takes the name Ivy, disguises herself as a boy, and tames a dying slime she calls Sora. Living off discarded items, Ivy travels and slowly finds kind adults, while the bigoted village headman's rule leads his village into decline. Manga adaptation of a light novel, published in English by Seven Seas.",
  "life_message": "Worth does not come from rank; kindness and resourcefulness can rebuild a life.",
